369
00:47:54,400 --> 00:48:02,640
just to summarize, throughout this talk, I essentially try to highlight some of the unique security and privacy challenges that we've seen in the majority world.

370
00:48:02,862 --> 00:48:15,600
I've also shown some of the solutions we've attempted to come up with and essentially highlighted the need to try and partner and work with local communities in trying to do this.

371
00:48:15,854 --> 00:48:25,060
